{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是发表期末考试成绩的日子。", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "下课时间的走廊上，挤满了来看考试排名的学生们。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": "下课时间的走廊上，挤满了来看考试排名的学生们。", "plain_idx": 194, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学还是一如既往的第一名呢」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1745", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真不愧是她。\\n　其他伙伴们的排名也都有进步呢」", "text_idx": 197, "plain": "「真不愧是她。　其他伙伴们的排名也都有进步呢」", "plain_idx": 198, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我立马找到了自己的名字。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起之前的考试，排名确实上升了一些。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而在那旁边。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "则是写着乾纱凪的名字。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我俩的总分完全相同，排名也是一样。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪在稍微远一点的地方，和濑名同学确认着排名。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀哎呀～？ 是不是有哪里搞错了啊～\\n　上面没有安洁的名字呢？」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": "「哎呀哎呀～？ 是不是有哪里搞错了啊～　上面没有安洁的名字呢？」", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3970", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁的名字在这边」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6577", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学真是爱开玩笑～\\n　在上一次考试中名列前茅的本女仆，\\n　怎么可能在那种……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「爱理同学真是爱开玩笑～　在上一次考试中名列前茅的本女仆，　怎么可能在那种……」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3971", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在那种……地方……」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3972", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果不继续努力的话就会变成这样哦？\\n　人类这种生物，总是退步得很快啊……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「如果不继续努力的话就会变成这样哦？　人类这种生物，总是退步得很快啊……」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6578", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔，这下安洁又要变回没用的女仆了……」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「唔唔唔，这下安洁又要变回没用的女仆了……」", "plain_idx": 221, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3973", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁的排名下降了啊。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在上一次的考试中，毕竟有濑名同学的帮忙。", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾和小乾的排名一样啊。而且都比上一次的排名提升了，真不愧是你俩～」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「新吾和小乾的排名一样啊。而且都比上一次的排名提升了，真不愧是你俩～」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1746", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这一次本来是没那么有把握的」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4185", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪似乎也找到了自己的名字，\\n在远处表现出很高兴的样子。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "纱凪似乎也找到了自己的名字，在远处表现出很高兴的样子。", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我想要跟她打声招呼，但还是忍住了。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟约好了，在学校里要表现得像路人一样。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，对于知道内情的人来说，\\n　现在的你和小乾就感觉……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": "「不过，对于知道内情的人来说，　现在的你和小乾就感觉……」", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1747", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我知道你想说什么」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我自己也觉得心里痒痒的。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是在交往之前的话，两人肯定会很自然地一起聊天看排名。", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是现在，我们却只能在远处对视。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然这样很不自然呢」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我倒是觉得你很厉害」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1748", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么？」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正常来说，第一次交到女朋友，\\n　肯定会很兴奋过头然后搞砸对吧？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「正常来说，第一次交到女朋友，　肯定会很兴奋过头然后搞砸对吧？」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1749", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你能做到如此自制，我觉得真的很厉害」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1750", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不过，正是因为第一次交到女朋友」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ht1751", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以才会把她看得很重要吧。\\n　虽然作为男生免不了会东想西想」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「所以才会把她看得很重要吧。　虽然作为男生免不了会东想西想」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是我想要慢慢地，以我们自己的节奏慢慢来」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瓜生新吾，你给我坐在这里来」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后的教室里只剩我们两人。", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我原本以为我们终于可以聊聊天了，结果她毫不客气地让我跪坐下。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "我原本以为我们终于可以聊聊天了，结果她毫不客气地让我跪坐下。", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么你在学校里叫我纱凪？\\n　为什么要在大家的面前握住我的手？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "「为什么你在学校里叫我纱凪？　为什么要在大家的面前握住我的手？」", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……还不是因为纱凪看到我的脸就立刻逃走了？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那种时候，我逃走不是理所当然的嘛……\\n　被那么近距离盯着看的话」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": "「那种时候，我逃走不是理所当然的嘛……　被那么近距离盯着看的话」", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4188", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是盯着脸看也不行吗？」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，为了确认，你能看着我的眼睛吗？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4189", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我遵从她的话，目不转睛地看着她。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4190", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……果然不行，就算是盯着看也禁止」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4191", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪可真是严格啊」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你的眼神也太温柔了。\\n　被这种眼神盯着看，我也会很困扰的……」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": "「你的眼神也太温柔了。　被这种眼神盯着看，我也会很困扰的……」", "plain_idx": 279, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4192", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你难道不能把眼神变得更冰冷一点吗？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4193", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用那种居高临下的眼神，难道你就不想骂骂我吗？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4194", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，完全不想」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——真是的，你这样笑着会让我也松懈下来的」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4195", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听好了，从现在开始你练习一下骂我」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4196", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来吧，尽管恨我吧。想说多么恶毒的话都行！」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4197", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这个，不做不行吗？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「当然了。我要彻底纠正你这，\\n　在教室里用温柔眼神看我的性格」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": "「当然了。我要彻底纠正你这，　在教室里用温柔眼神看我的性格」", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4198", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这性格真的需要纠正吗。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来我不得不骂一下纱凪才行。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来吧，怎么了？快点来骂我吧」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4199", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这……就算你让我骂你，\\n　面对自己喜欢的女孩子，我可想不到有什么地方能骂啊」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": "「这……就算你让我骂你，　面对自己喜欢的女孩子，我可想不到有什么地方能骂啊」", "plain_idx": 301, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以骂的地方要多少有多少吧」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4200", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像你这样的飞机场丑八怪，没有活在这个世界上的价值！」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4201", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「性格糟透了，也没有色气可言，\\n　成为你恋人的男生可真是不幸啊！」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「性格糟透了，也没有色气可言，　成为你恋人的男生可真是不幸啊！」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4202", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你模仿一下我刚才说的试试看？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4203", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这稍微有点……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我不会生气的，说说看吧？男生并不是只需要温柔就好，\\n　说不定我被骂了之后还会重新迷上你？」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": "「我不会生气的，说说看吧？男生并不是只需要温柔就好，　说不定我被骂了之后还会重新迷上你？」", "plain_idx": 313, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4204", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我完全摸不着头脑，但现在貌似不说不行了。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么就……」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "为了说出这不习惯的话语，我清了清嗓子。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像你这样的飞机场丑八怪，没有活在这个世界上的价值！」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「性格糟透了，也没有色气可言，\\n　成为你恋人的男生可真是不幸啊！」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「性格糟透了，也没有色气可言，　成为你恋人的男生可真是不幸啊！」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……就算你不说我也知道」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不不不不！\\n　既然会这么失落，为什么还要我说啊？！」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「不不不不！　既然会这么失落，为什么还要我说啊？！」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不如说，你说这话是不是完全发自内心啊？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4206", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是你想多了」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哎，真是够了，我从明天开始，\\n　可要尽情地辱骂新吾了」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": "「……哎，真是够了，我从明天开始，　可要尽情地辱骂新吾了」", "plain_idx": 327, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4207", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「臭虫，臭虫，新吾你这个臭虫，\\n　嗯，就这样吧」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "「臭虫，臭虫，新吾你这个臭虫，　嗯，就这样吧」", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4208", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可真是让人怀念的称呼啊」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，你这家伙！不要擅自在那高兴啊，臭虫！！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4209", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每到这种时候，我无论被说什么都会情不自禁地笑出来。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，咱们还是先去活动室吧」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route05_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔、嗯。脚会不会有些麻？\\n　抱歉，让你跪坐了这么长时间……」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": "「唔、嗯。脚会不会有些麻？　抱歉，让你跪坐了这么长时间……」", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4210", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
